    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b835827bd818aeeeba16406e8b62fa51.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of enemies spawn in waves to attempt to destroy the core building. Three players team up to defeat them and must endure to the final wave to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.poster.avif?t=1755252669\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.webm?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.mp4?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/a1b3ed36dd37f68f1056b93a139a0a7c.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of unique ideas is embodied in the characters. Players have the freedom to build their characters in various ways, going beyond the conventional tank, damage dealer and support roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in a MOBA, heroes can be customized during the game by purchasing items to amplify their powers, unlock synergies, and evolve their playstyle as the battle unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.poster.avif?t=1755252669\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.webm?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.mp4?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/ac1f746d563ef9a5db9c4d4e19fab774.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=325 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate test in Hard Mode. Each time you defeat a few waves, you\u2019ll face a critical decision\u2014choose from 3 increasingly difficult options to raise the stakes. You must win the round in order to unlock the next level of intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fear not, your journey isn\u2019t without its rewards. Perks and advantages gained from account progression will stay active, giving you a better fighting chance to overcome tougher runs. If you think you\u2019ve mastered the normal game, Hard Mode will push your skills to the limit and demand every ounce of strategy and teamwork to succeed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> After every few waves, you\u2019ll be given 3 random choices to increase the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory is Essential:</strong> Only by winning each round will you earn the chance to face even more brutal challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression-fueled Power:</strong> Your account progression ensures that the perks and advantages you\u2019ve earned stay with you on Hard Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Gameplay: Form your trio and stand together against the enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Pay to Win:\u00a0All progression is earned through gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability:\u00a0Hard Mode's procedural gameplay keeps every run unpredictable and delivers a fresh challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Servers:\u00a0Our global server setup ensures smooth, low-latency matches across all regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for Fair Play:\u00a0Game's systems are built to prevent exploits and cheating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b835827bd818aeeeba16406e8b62fa51.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of enemies spawn in waves to attempt to destroy the core building. Three players team up to defeat them and must endure to the final wave to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.poster.avif?t=1755252669\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.webm?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.mp4?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/a1b3ed36dd37f68f1056b93a139a0a7c.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=181 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selection of unique ideas is embodied in the characters. Players have the freedom to build their characters in various ways, going beyond the conventional tank, damage dealer and support roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in a MOBA, heroes can be customized during the game by purchasing items to amplify their powers, unlock synergies, and evolve their playstyle as the battle unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.poster.avif?t=1755252669\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.webm?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.mp4?t=1755252669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/ac1f746d563ef9a5db9c4d4e19fab774.avif?t=1755252669\" data-has-big width=800 height=325 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate test in Hard Mode. Each time you defeat a few waves, you\u2019ll face a critical decision\u2014choose from 3 increasingly difficult options to raise the stakes. You must win the round in order to unlock the next level of intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fear not, your journey isn\u2019t without its rewards. Perks and advantages gained from account progression will stay active, giving you a better fighting chance to overcome tougher runs. If you think you\u2019ve mastered the normal game, Hard Mode will push your skills to the limit and demand every ounce of strategy and teamwork to succeed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> After every few waves, you\u2019ll be given 3 random choices to increase the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory is Essential:</strong> Only by winning each round will you earn the chance to face even more brutal challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression-fueled Power:</strong> Your account progression ensures that the perks and advantages you\u2019ve earned stay with you on Hard Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Gameplay: Form your trio and stand together against the enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Pay to Win:\u00a0All progression is earned through gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability:\u00a0Hard Mode's procedural gameplay keeps every run unpredictable and delivers a fresh challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Servers:\u00a0Our global server setup ensures smooth, low-latency matches across all regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for Fair Play:\u00a0Game's systems are built to prevent exploits and cheating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Wavecrashers is a 3-player co-op strategy game where heroes unite to fend off relentless waves of enemies. Master unique heroes, win strategic mini-games, and dive into a deeply replayable experience built for teamwork.",
